    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Local roots · Global reach</div>
          <h1>Localio<br>Local to <span>Global.</span></h1>
          <p>Connecting local businesses, products, and talent to a world of opportunity. Discover unique finds, support makers, and grow beyond borders.</p>
          <div class="hero-buttons"><a class="btn" href="#shop">Explore Products <span>→</span></a><a class="btn btn-outline" style="color:#fff;border-color:#ffffff77" href="#about">Discover Localio</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration representing global connections"><div class="globe">🌐</div><div class="floating-note note-one">🌱 Local makers<small>Ideas start here</small></div><div class="floating-note note-two">✈️ Global reach<small>Possibilities everywhere</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="benefits"><div class="wrap benefit-grid">
      <div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">🌿</div><div><strong>Support Local</strong><span>Help communities thrive</span></div></div>
      <div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">🌐</div><div><strong>Global Marketplace</strong><span>Discover more, anywhere</span></div></div>
      <div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">📦</div><div><strong>Simple Ordering</strong><span>Clear and convenient</span></div></div>
      <div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-icon">🤝</div><div><strong>Business Connections</strong><span>Build meaningful partnerships</span></div></div>
    </div></div>

    <section id="shop">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">The Localio marketplace</div><h2>Great finds. Bigger possibilities.</h2><p>Explore local favorites, handmade treasures, and useful services — all in one place.</p></div>
        <div class="toolbar"><label class="searchbox">🔎 <input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="Search products..." aria-label="Search products"></label><div class="filters" id="filters"><button class="filter active" data-category="All">All</button><button class="filter" data-category="Food">Food</button><button class="filter" data-category="Handmade">Handmade</button><button class="filter" data-category="Fashion">Fashion</button><button class="filter" data-category="Tech">Tech</button><button class="filter" data-category="Wellness">Wellness</button></div></div>
        <div class="product-grid" id="productGrid" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about"><div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="about-visual"><div class="big-emoji">🧑🏽‍🌾 🌍</div><div class="about-chip">Small local steps. Big global dreams.</div></div>
      <div><div class="eyebrow">About Localio</div><h2>Rooted in community.<br>Built for the world.</h2><p class="muted">Localio is a multipurpose platform designed to help local producers, creators, service providers, and businesses find new opportunities. Our goal is to make discovery and collaboration simpler, fairer, and more accessible.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Discover products from local makers</li><li>Help businesses reach new customers</li><li>Explore services and collaboration opportunities</li><li>Encourage responsible, community-led growth</li></ul><a class="btn" href="#services">Explore our services →</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">More than a shop</div><h2>One platform. Many ways to grow.</h2><p>Whether you're shopping, selling, or building a business, Localio is designed to help you take the next step.</p></div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🛍️</div><h3>Product Marketplace</h3><p>Showcase products, discover new makers, and connect buyers with unique local goods.</p><a href="#shop">Explore products →</a></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🚀</div><h3>Business Growth</h3><p>Build your brand, reach potential customers, and find new collaboration opportunities.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Business growth">Discuss your goals →</a></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🌏</div><h3>Global Trade Enquiries</h3><p>Start conversations about wholesale, sourcing, distribution, and international opportunities.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Global trade enquiry">Start an enquiry →</a></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🎨</div><h3>Creative & Handmade</h3><p>Give artisans and independent creators a place to share the story behind their work.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Creative and handmade">Partner with us →</a></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">💼</div><h3>Professional Services</h3><p>Connect with people and businesses for digital, creative, and operational projects.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Professional services">Tell us what you need →</a></article>
        <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🤝</div><h3>Partnerships</h3><p>Collaborate with Localio on community projects, supplier networks, and new ideas.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Partnership">Become a partner →</a></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section id="impact" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap"><div class="order-banner"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your next great find awaits</div><h2>Order local. Think global.</h2><p>Browse the marketplace, add your favorites to the cart, and prepare an order request in just a few steps.</p><a class="btn" href="#shop">Shop the marketplace →</a></div><div class="art" aria-hidden="true">📦 🌱 📱</div></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>Local-first</strong><span>Community at heart</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Multi-purpose</strong><span>Products and services</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Global-minded</strong><span>Opportunity without borders</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>People-powered</strong><span>Built around connection</span></div></div></div></section>


    <section id="support">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Here to help</div><h2>Customer support & policies</h2><p>Clear information for customers, sellers, and business partners. Review these starter policies and customize them to your actual operations before launch.</p></div>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">💬</div><h3>Contact support</h3><p>Questions about an order, product, or partnership? Email our team and include your order reference if you have one.</p><a href="mailto:localiopvt@proton.me?subject=Localio%20support%20request">Email support →</a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🚚</div><h3>Shipping & delivery</h3><p>Delivery timelines and charges depend on the seller, destination, and courier. We will confirm the shipping details before an order is accepted.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Shipping enquiry">Ask about delivery →</a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">↩️</div><h3>Returns & refunds</h3><p>Return eligibility, time limits, and refund timing must be confirmed for each product and seller. Contact support before sending an item back.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Returns enquiry">Ask about a return →</a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🔐</div><h3>Privacy</h3><p>Only submit information needed to handle your enquiry. This demo does not store form submissions in a database; email links open your own email app.</p><a href="#privacy-policy">Read privacy notice ↓</a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">📃</div><h3>Terms of use</h3><p>Product details and prices in this demo are examples. An order request is not a confirmed order until Localio confirms availability, shipping, and final price.</p><a href="#terms-policy">Read terms ↓</a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🏪</div><h3>Seller enquiries</h3><p>Interested in listing products or offering services through Localio? Tell us about your business, products, and location.</p><a href="#contact" data-service="Become a seller">Become a seller →</a></article>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid" style="margin-top:28px;align-items:start">
          <article class="service-card" id="privacy-policy">
            <h3>Privacy notice — starter template</h3>
            <p>Localio should explain what personal data it collects, why it collects it, how long it keeps it, which service providers process it, how users can request access or deletion, and how to contact the privacy team. In this static demo, contact and order forms prepare an email in the visitor’s email application and do not themselves save submissions to a Localio database.</p>
            <p><strong>Before launch:</strong> Replace this starter notice with a legally reviewed policy that reflects your actual hosting, analytics, cookies, payment, and customer-account setup. Contact: <a href="mailto:localiopvt@proton.me">localiopvt@proton.me</a>.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card" id="terms-policy">
            <h3>Terms of use — starter template</h3>
